          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "গুরুত্ব — gurutvô — \"importance\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "এই সিদ্ধান্তের গুরুত্ব অনেক। ei siddhānter gurutvô ônek. This decision matters a great deal."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "গুরুত্ব (gurutvô) is Sanskrit gurutva, weight (Monier-Williams), from guru 'heavy'. Bengali uses the weight for importance, as English speaks of a weighty matter."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
