          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ব্যাখ্যা করা (bækhyā kôrā) is Sanskrit vyākhyā, explanation or commentary (Monier-Williams), with করা. It goes further than বোঝানো: it lays out what a text or a law means."
